<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3405/10  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5008/13  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.6831/38  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.2677/82  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     30.94/95   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.0752/72  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1505.8/6.8 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     111.15/25  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.6041/09  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.3160/97  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.7637/57  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4009/16  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7952/57  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7315/25  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6794/04</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$378.15/378.45</p>
</text>
